-
-## 20. Publication
-
-**Form.** A focused update to the existing paper and repository.
-
-**Required content:**
-
-- all six estimates with intervals, labels, derived intervals, patterns and summary;
-- direction stated as CACHE minus FRESH using the §9.6 templates;
-- the e and H distributions;
-- every adverse, negligible, sign-only and offsetting finding, stated literally;
-- the §14.4 provenance limit and the near-monomorphism caveat;
-- the hashed focal-selection definition;
-- the §10 notes, as unprivileged;
-- full reproducibility material: protocol, keys, build IDs, manifests, audit report, benchmark receipt and ledger totals;
-- the legacy failure history.
-
-**Exclusions:**
-
-- no mediation, allele, biology, universal-mechanism or TORUS claims;
-- INVALID estimates are never interpreted;
-- a failed route yields only a feasibility report, never a scientific negative.
-
